<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Doomzee’s Blog</title>
<meta name="description" content="Doomzee’s developer blog with tutorials, guides, and tips for beginner coders.">
<meta name="google-adsense-account" content="ca-pub-8719499369858742">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,500;6..72,700&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#F2F4F3; --surface:#FFFFFF; --ink:#151A18; --muted:#505A56; --line:#CBD2CF;
  --accent:#0F6B5C; --accent-ink:#FFFFFF;
  --s1:4px; --s2:8px; --s3:12px; --s4:16px; --s6:24px; --s8:32px; --s12:48px; --s16:64px; --s24:96px;
  --head:"Newsreader",Georgia,serif; --body:"Instrument Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;
  box-sizing:border-box; padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px); padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#0F1412;--surface:#171E1B;--ink:#E7EDEA;--muted:#9AA7A2;--line:#29332F;--accent:#5CCDB6;--accent-ink:#0F1412;}
}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#0F1412;--surface:#171E1B;--ink:#E7EDEA;--muted:#9AA7A2;--line:#29332F;--accent:#5CCDB6;--accent-ink:#0F1412;}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
html{scroll-padding-top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 72px)}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 16px/1.6 var(--body)}
a{color:inherit}
a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
.wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--s6)}

header{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:5;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto;height:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);background:var(--bg);z-index:6}
header .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;height:56px}
.brand{font:700 20px var(--head);text-decoration:none}
nav{display:flex;gap:var(--s6)}
nav a{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
nav a:hover,nav a[aria-current]{color:var(--ink)}
nav a[aria-current]{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:6px;text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-decoration-color:var(--accent)}

.hero{padding:var(--s24) 0 var(--s16);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:var(--s12);align-items:end}
.hero h1{font:700 clamp(40px,6.4vw,68px)/1.05 var(--head);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0}
.hero p{margin:0 0 var(--s6);color:var(--muted);font-size:18px;line-height:1.55}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:var(--s3) var(--s6);border-radius:4px}
.btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}
.btn:focus-visible{outline-offset:4px}

.group{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:var(--s12) 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:var(--s12)}
.group h2{font:700 24px/1.2 var(--head);margin:0}
.group h2 span{display:block;margin-top:var(--s2);font:400 14px/1.5 var(--body);color:var(--muted)}
.post{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:var(--s1) var(--s8);padding:var(--s6) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-decoration:none}
.post:first-child{padding-top:0}
.post:last-child{border-bottom:0;padding-bottom:0}
.post h3{font:700 22px/1.3 var(--head);margin:0}
.post:hover h3{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}
.post p{grid-column:1;margin:0;color:var(--muted);max-width:56ch}
.post time{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap;padding-top:var(--s1)}
.pill{grid-column:1;justify-self:start;margin-top:var(--s3);font:500 12px/1.5 var(--body);padding:var(--s1) var(--s3);border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted)}

footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:var(--s8) 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}

@media (max-width:760px){
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--s6);padding:var(--s16) 0 var(--s12)}
  .group{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--s6);padding:var(--s8) 0}
  .post{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .post time{grid-column:1;grid-row:auto;order:-1}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="index.html">Doomzee’s Blog</a>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="index.html" aria-current="page">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero">
      <h1>Coding tips and guides for beginners</h1>
      <div>
        <p>I’m Doomzee, a young dev writing tutorials and web dev guides in plain language.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="posts/how-to-code.html">Read the beginner’s guide</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="group" aria-labelledby="g1">
      <h2 id="g1">Getting started<span>For your first lines of code.</span></h2>
      <div>
        <a class="post" href="posts/how-to-code.html">
          <h3>How to Code: A Beginner’s Guide</h3>
          <time datetime="2025-07-03">July 3, 2025</time>
          <p>A walkthrough of the basics: getting started, choosing a language, and writing your first lines of code.</p>
          <span class="pill">Beginner</span>
        </a>
        <a class="post" href="posts/how-to-start-coding.html">
          <h3>How to Start Coding</h3>
          <time datetime="2025-07-03">July 3, 2025</time>
          <p>Start coding today with Python, HTML, and JavaScript, explained in simple terms.</p>
          <span class="pill">Beginner</span>
        </a>
        <a class="post" href="posts/html-css-js-guide.html">
          <h3>HTML, CSS and JS Guide</h3>
          <time datetime="2025-07-03">July 3, 2025</time>
          <p>A short introduction to the three core languages of the web.</p>
          <span class="pill">Web basics</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="group" aria-labelledby="g2">
      <h2 id="g2">JavaScript<span>Habits worth learning early.</span></h2>
      <div>
        <a class="post" href="posts/basic-javascript-tips.html">
          <h3>Basic JavaScript Tips</h3>
          <time datetime="2025-07-03">July 3, 2025</time>
          <p>Tips to improve your JavaScript, from <code>let</code> vs <code>const</code> to arrow functions.</p>
          <span class="pill">JavaScript</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="group" aria-labelledby="g3">
      <h2 id="g3">Frameworks and styling<span>Choosing tools and making sites look right.</span></h2>
      <div>
        <a class="post" href="posts/flask-vs-django.html">
          <h3>Flask vs Django</h3>
          <time datetime="2025-07-03">July 3, 2025</time>
          <p>Two popular Python web frameworks compared, so you can pick the one that fits your project.</p>
          <span class="pill">Python</span>
        </a>
        <a class="post" href="posts/responsive-design-beginners.html">
          <h3>Responsive Design for Beginners</h3>
          <time datetime="2025-07-03">July 3, 2025</time>
          <p>Make your site work on any screen using Tailwind’s responsive utilities.</p>
          <span class="pill">Tailwind CSS</span>
        </a>
        <a class="post" href="posts/intro-to-tailwind.html">
          <h3>Intro to Tailwind CSS</h3>
          <time datetime="2025-07-03">July 3, 2025</time>
          <p>Why Tailwind is my go-to utility framework, and how to use it well.</p>
          <span class="pill">Tailwind CSS</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">&copy; 2025 Doomzee. All rights reserved.</div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
